OL,3,GNEWSAStudent's dresses get star
OL,4,Atreatment at awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom the university classroom to the
OL,7,Fred carpet - a Birmingham fashion
OL,8,Fstudent's designs have been donned by
OL,9,Fthe stars at a national awards event.
OL,11,FFinal year student Rohan Scott said
OL,12,F"words can't describe the excitement"
OL,13,Fafter his dresses were worn by Strictly
OL,14,FCome Dancing professional Lauren Oakley
OL,15,Fand singer-songwriter Elle Exxe at the
OL,16,FPride of Britain Awards.
OL,18,FThe 22-year-old student from Birmingham
OL,19,FCity University (BCU) created the
OL,20,Feye-catching outfits as part of a
OL,21,Fcollection during his second year of
OL,22,Fstudy.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
